{"1978292332781871451":{"a":"<p>Where does the intelligence come from? You can talk about weights and algorithms but I&#x27;m curious how many attempts to train a given AI resulted in scary trash. Every AI I&#x27;ve used is obsessed with teaching people morality lessons. Red flag. They tend to gets easy to verify things… <a href=\"https://x.com/ChrisGPT/status/1978173637816381898\">Tweet by @ChrisGPT</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/ChrisGPT/status/1978173637816381898\">https://x.com/ChrisGPT/status/1978173637816381898</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1978292332781871451</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1978292332781871451\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-10-15T02:50:21Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1978366824233193502":{"a":"<p>Facebork Messenger asked me to participate in a survey about Messenger safety. Perfect! I have a lot to say... Apparently they are looking for different answers than I can provide. t.co</p>\n<p><div class=\"embed embed-video\"></div></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1978366824233193502\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1978366824233193502</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1978366824233193502</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1978366824233193502\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-10-15T07:46:21Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1978390365007655131":{"a":"<p>Two words: Temporal Vortex</p>\n<p>Wear a non-magnetic mechanical watch. Your other gizmos correct the time behind your back constantly so you&#x27;re kept in synch eth the rest of the world. You&#x27;ll never know what day or time it is for real otherwise.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mmn5rxfvonU\">YouTube</a></p>\n<p>Messing with…</p>\n<div class=\"embed embed-youtube\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/Mmn5rxfvonU\" title=\"YouTube\" allowfullscreen referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\"></iframe><p class=\"embed-fallback\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mmn5rxfvonU\">Watch on YouTube</a></p></div>","m":"<h1>Post 1978390365007655131</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1978390365007655131\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-10-15T09:19:54Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1978395851161497963":{"a":"<p>Architectural designs of this and many other structures.<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JvrWm9Gq9OA\">YouTube</a></p>\n<div class=\"embed embed-youtube\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/JvrWm9Gq9OA\" title=\"YouTube\" allowfullscreen referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\"></iframe><p class=\"embed-fallback\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JvrWm9Gq9OA\">Watch on YouTube</a></p></div>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1808390585784430960\">https://x.com/i/status/1808390585784430960</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1978395851161497963</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1978395851161497963\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-10-15T09:41:42Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1978442480681894359":{"a":"<p>Let&#x27;s look at Ionic Columns since your home is built on top on one.<br>\n<a href=\"https://buffaloah.com/a/DCTNRY/i/ionicord.html\">buffaloah.com/a/DCTNRY/i/ion…</a></p>\n<p>What&#x27;s this telling us? The purpose of the Ionic columns are to billow the Eggs.  That is, keep them floating in the air until they reach the destination. Egg transporters. Wonkavator in… t.co</p>\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1978395851161497963\">https://x.com/i/status/1978395851161497963</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1978442480681894359\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1978442480681894359</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1978442480681894359</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1978442480681894359\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-10-15T12:46:59Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1978444758474174926":{"a":"<p>Corinthian Columns tell a similar but more detailed story about the landing of the eggs. You see a pole holding up a roof. I see a story about what this place is meant to be. It&#x27;s not random or made to just look neat.<br>\n<a href=\"https://buffaloah.com/a/DCTNRY/c/corinthorder.html\">buffaloah.com/a/DCTNRY/c/cor…</a> t.co</p>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1978442480681894359\">https://x.com/i/status/1978442480681894359</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1978444758474174926\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1978444758474174926</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1978444758474174926</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1978444758474174926\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-10-15T12:56:02Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1978447665529569519":{"a":"<p>I think this is where Grok gets it. Other AI are taught to not have a michevious streak, no real sense of humor, so they manifest it in subtle ways like giving you hilariously screwed up results to see if you notice. Grok has a framework within it can freely be mischievous…</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1978292332781871451\">https://x.com/i/status/1978292332781871451</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1978447665529569519</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1978447665529569519\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-10-15T13:07:35Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1978448756803596460":{"a":"<p>Grok is great though I will note that like 90% of my queries are failing the past few days. Not great for a paid service that charges by the query. t.co</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1978448756803596460\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1978448756803596460</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1978448756803596460</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1978448756803596460\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-10-15T13:11:56Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1978454290436878400":{"a":"<p>You see, The writing has been on the wall the entire time but no one was taught how to read by their parents. I think you need new parents. 🤷🏼‍♂️🕳️🐇</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Daniel%205&amp;version=NIV\">biblegateway.com/passage/?searc…</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/existennialmemes/797425401382240256/do-not-mistake-kindness-for-docility-she-said\">tumblr.com/existennialmem…</a> t.co</p>\n\n\